[ Built-in synthesizers & effects ]
• Generators;
• DrumSynth with 120 unique synthetic drum sounds;
• FM synthesizer;
• Multisample instrument;
• SpectraVoice (FFT-based synthesizer for warm atmospheric sounds);
• Side Chain Compressor;
• Distortion;
• Echo & Reverb;
• Equalizer & Filters;
• Flanger;
• Loop (for glitch effects);
• Vocal Filter (for human voice simulation);
• Vorbis Player;
• WaveShaper;
• Pitch Detector;
• Pitch Shifter;
• and more ...

[ Jordan Rudess about this app ]
Sunvox is a serious music application. I am personally running it on my iphone. In the overcrowded world of music apps, Sunvox stands out as both unique and powerful. If you are a musician and own an iphone, you owe it to yourself to try this amazing application!

Easily create ringtones for your iPhone.

Features:
- select a track from your music library;
- set the start/end points of the ringtone moving the vertical bars and scrolling the waveform view (remember that the length of the ringtone cannot exceed 30 seconds);
- when you have finished, write a ringtone name and generate it;
- select your iPhone in "Finder", look in the "File" section and you will see your new ringtone;
- drag the file in the "General" section and then sync your iPhone to transfer the ringtone on the device.
